---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Writing desk — Life as Sakti" description="Write a new story, edit an existing article, or update your website.">
<section class="desk-heading"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR WRITING DESK</p><h1>Make room for<br/><em>your next story.</em></h1><p class="intro">Write, revise and add images with the visual editor.</p><a class="button" href="https://app.pagescms.org/">Open story editor ↗</a><p>Sign in with GitHub, choose <strong>sakti1977 / saktibagchiblog</strong>, then open <strong>Blog posts</strong>.</p></section>
<section class="desk-columns"><div><h2>Write a new story</h2><ol><li>In Blog posts, choose <strong>Add new</strong>.</li><li>Add a title, publication date, web address, summary and story. Upload a cover image if you want one.</li><li>Keep <strong>Keep as draft</strong> enabled while writing.</li><li>When ready, turn off the draft switch and save. The preview updates after the website finishes rebuilding, usually within a few minutes.</li></ol></div><div><h2>Edit an existing story</h2><ol><li>Search for its title in Blog posts.</li><li>Open it, make your changes and save.</li><li>Keep its existing web address so saved links continue to work.</li><li>Check the updated story on the <a href="/archive/">writing archive</a>.</li></ol><p>Use <strong>Website pages</strong> to edit About, Contact or Explore. Use <strong>Homepage and navigation</strong> to change the introduction and menu.</p></div></section>
<section class="address-helper"><h2>Make a web address</h2><p>For a new story, enter its title and date below. Copy the result into the editor’s <strong>Permanent web address</strong> field.</p><label for="story-title">Story title</label><input id="story-title" type="text" placeholder="What I learned along the way"/><label for="story-date">Publication date</label><input id="story-date" type="date"/><label for="story-address">Suggested web address</label><input id="story-address" readonly placeholder="Your web address will appear here"/><button id="copy-address" type="button" disabled>Copy address</button><p id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
<section class="desk-note"><h2>Before you save</h2><p>Drafts stay out of the website, search and RSS feed. The repository is public, so saved draft files can still be read on GitHub. Keep confidential drafts elsewhere.</p><p>Review complex tables and embeds after editing. The editor’s source view can help preserve existing formatting. A separate website preview for unpublished drafts is not available yet.</p><p>The current publishing destination is <a href="https://preview.saktibagchi.in/">preview.saktibagchi.in</a>. The production WordPress site remains separate.</p></section>
</Layout>
<script>
const title=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#story-title')!;
const date=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#story-date')!;
const address=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#story-address')!;
const button=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy-address')!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#copy-status')!;
const today=new Date();date.value=`${today.getFullYear()}-${String(today.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(today.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`;
function update(){const slug=title.value.normalize('NFKC').toLowerCase().replace(/[^\p{L}\p{N}]+/gu,'-').replace(/^-|-$/g,'');address.value=slug&&date.value?`/${date.value.replaceAll('-','/')}/${slug}/`:'';button.disabled=!address.value;status.textContent='';}
title.addEventListener('input',update);date.addEventListener('input',update);
button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(address.value);status.textContent='Copied. Paste this into Permanent web address in the editor.';}catch{address.focus();address.select();status.textContent='Select and copy the highlighted address.';}});
</script>
<style>
.desk-heading{padding:64px 0 40px;max-width:800px}.desk-heading h1{font:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)/1.1 Georgia,serif}.desk-heading em{color:#6b775d}.desk-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;border-top:1px solid #ddd9ce;padding:32px 0}.desk-columns h2,.address-helper h2,.desk-note h2{font:30px Georgia,serif}.desk-columns li{margin:14px 0;line-height:1.7}.address-helper{max-width:680px;padding:24px 0 40px}.address-helper label{display:block;margin-top:20px}.address-helper input{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #aaa99d;background:transparent;font:inherit;box-sizing:border-box}.address-helper button{margin-top:16px;padding:12px 18px;background:#2d4c41;color:white;border:0;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.address-helper button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.desk-note{border-top:1px solid #ddd9ce;padding:24px 0 60px;max-width:800px;line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:640px){.desk-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}}
</style>
